          "ruleId": "SWC-114",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Transaction Order Dependence\nThe value of the call is dependent on balance or storage write\nThis can lead to race conditions. An attacker may be able to run a transaction after our transaction which can change the value of the call"
          },
          "properties": {
            "sentinelStatus": "candidate",
            "confidence": "unknown",
            "evidence": [
              "mythril:SWC-114: The value of the call is dependent on balance or storage write\nThis can lead to race conditions. An attacker may be able to run a transaction after our transaction which can change the value of the call"
